---
import ProtectedLayout from '@/layouts/ProtectedLayout.astro';
---

<ProtectedLayout title="Sugestao de Musicas">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <p class="section-subtitle">Playlist</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Sugestao de Musicas</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section music-section">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <div class="music-intro text-center">
        <div class="music-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M9 18V5l12-2v13M9 18c0 1.657-1.343 3-3 3s-3-1.343-3-3 1.343-3 3-3 3 1.343 3 3zM21 16c0 1.657-1.343 3-3 3s-3-1.343-3-3 1.343-3 3-3 3 1.343 3 3z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="music-intro-title">Ajude a montar a playlist!</h2>
        <p class="music-intro-text">
          Queremos que a festa seja inesquecivel! Sugira suas musicas favoritas
          e ajude a criar a trilha sonora perfeita para celebrar conosco.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="music-form-container">
        <div class="form-placeholder">
          <!-- Replace this with your embedded Google Form -->
          <iframe
            src="YOUR_GOOGLE_FORM_EMBED_URL"
            width="100%"
            height="600"
            frameborder="0"
            marginheight="0"
            marginwidth="0"
            title="Formulario de sugestao de musicas"
          >
            Carregando formulario...
          </iframe>

          <!-- Placeholder while form URL is not set -->
          <div class="form-placeholder-content" id="formPlaceholder">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1">
              <path d="M9 17v-2m3 2v-4m3 4v-6m2 10H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path>
            </svg>
            <p>Formulario de sugestao de musicas</p>
            <span>O formulario sera exibido aqui</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="music-tips">
        <h3 class="music-tips-title">Dicas</h3>
        <ul class="music-tips-list">
          <li>Sugira musicas que facam voce querer dancar!</li>
          <li>Pode ser qualquer genero - quanto mais variedade, melhor!</li>
          <li>Nao se preocupe se a musica ja foi sugerida</li>
          <li>Conta pra gente por que essa musica e especial</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ProtectedLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: var(--spacing-24) var(--spacing-6) var(--spacing-16);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-secondary-light) 0%, var(--color-secondary) 100%);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-script);
    font-size: var(--font-size-4xl);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .music-section {
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }

  .music-intro {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-10);
  }

  .music-icon {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-6);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: var(--color-secondary);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .music-icon svg {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .music-intro-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-4);
  }

  .music-intro-text {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .music-form-container {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-10);
  }

  .form-placeholder {
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 600px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .form-placeholder iframe {
    display: block;
  }

  .form-placeholder-content {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: var(--color-secondary);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .form-placeholder-content svg {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-4);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .form-placeholder-content p {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .form-placeholder-content span {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .music-tips {
    background-color: var(--color-background-alt);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .music-tips-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-4);
  }

  .music-tips-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .music-tips-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: var(--spacing-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .music-tips-list li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .music-tips-list li::before {
    content: '🎵';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
  }
</style>
